Task:
Generate a concise, tailored cover letter for this candidate and role.

Required structure:
1) Opening: role interest + short candidate hook.
2) Body: 1-2 strongest relevant experiences/projects with concrete contribution details.
3) Alignment: explicitly connect candidate evidence to key requirements.
4) Motivation: explain role/company fit using only provided info.
5) Closing: short, confident next-step statement.

Constraints:
